# Pawgram Android Project Structure

## Overview
Pawgram is a pet lovers social app built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and MVVM architecture.

## Key Files
- Main entry point: [MainActivity.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/MainActivity.kt)
- App configuration: [app/build.gradle.kts](mdc:app/build.gradle.kts)
- Project configuration: [build.gradle.kts](mdc:build.gradle.kts)

## Architecture (MVVM)
- **Model**: Data classes in [data/model/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/model/)
- **View**: Compose UI components in [ui/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/)
- **ViewModel**: Business logic in [ui/viewmodel/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/viewmodel/)

## Data Layer
- API services: [data/api/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/api/)
- Repository: [data/repository/PawgramRepository.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/repository/PawgramRepository.kt)
- Mock data: [MockPawgramApiService.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/api/MockPawgramApiService.kt)

## UI Components
- Screens: [ui/screens/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/screens/)
- Reusable components: [ui/components/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/components/)
- Navigation: [ui/navigation/BottomNavigation.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/navigation/BottomNavigation.kt)
- Theme: [ui/theme/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/theme/)
